<title>JAPAN: Nippon Steel sees Y160 bln 97/98 parent oper prft.</title>
<headline>Nippon Steel sees Y160 bln 97/98 parent oper prft.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Steel Corp said on Thursday it expects a parent operating profit of 160 billion yen in the current 1997/98 business year.  </p>
<p>Nippon Steel posted a parent operating profit of 128.53 billion yen in the 1996/97 business year.</p>
</text>
